    "title": "Google winds down Jules AI agent, folds its learnings into Antigravity",
    "summary": "Google's integration of Jules into Antigravity may streamline AI development but could disrupt developers reliant on Jules' unique features.\nThe post Google winds down Jules AI agent, folds its learnings into Antigravity appeared first on Crypto Briefing.",
    "hasSummary": true,
    "link": "https://cryptobriefing.com/google-winds-down-jules-ai-antigravity/",
